i have 5 of the md9600 running opengd.  they all are very sensitive to the voltage input.  at 12.0vdc they only put out about 10-15 watts FM, but at 13.2v they put out 40watts and 13.8v closer to 50watts.  i see 7-8amps of draw at the 13.2v and get max 45watts.  this is all VHF analog FM numbers into swr1.1 antenna.   on UHF i get about 1/2 the output power as VHF with same 7-8 amps draw.  i have not done any calibrations.  next time i upgrade the firmware i probably will.<br>--gaspo.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=403">AF6MQ</a> — Tue Mar 05, 2024 2:05 am</p><hr />
